        "episode_id": "ep-35f04bce441bf827",
        "speaker_id": "person:speaker-02",
        "text": "Honestly, A great RFC starts with context and constraints, then options. We've seen this play out at teams using Notion. Once you internalize that, the rest of the decisions get easier.",
